{"ID":"20240312093544-idgh368","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240312093544-idgh368","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312093544-idgh368\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172121-4q11h5s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172107-ndopwah\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312172121-u5zg134\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【白头翁汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312172121-4q11h5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-4q11h5s","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百八十七条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-edak4cw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-edak4cw","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：热利下重者，「白头翁汤」治之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-ezdkw5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-ezdkw5m","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"伤寒论有好几个地方出现热利，第一个葛芩连汤的时候有热利，但是葛芩连汤一定是有表症。第二个热利黄芩汤，黄芩汤的热利一定有肚痛。第三个黄连汤热利，黄连汤是寒热并结的，有寒有热的。这个白头翁汤也是纯热利，大便拉出来十几次，肛门很痛，里急很痛，上完厕所还想继续上。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-a0mb1a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-a0mb1a1","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-njpfncu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-njpfncu","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁二两。黄连、黄柏、秦皮各三两。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-tvfyyzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-tvfyyzx","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水七升，煮取二升，去滓，温服一升，不愈，更服一升。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-i15oyv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-i15oyv7","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦皮是很好的止痢的药，能够润肠。黄连胃里面。黄柏是肠子里面。黄芩比较走上焦。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-azx39ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-azx39ic","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果一个病人来找你，他一天下痢十几次，但是很奇怪，有的时候两三天热利，很臭，有一天大便和血混在一起。有的时候又没有。这个时候用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桃花汤跟白头翁汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-a86af93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-a86af93","updated":"20240312172121"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果遇到疟疾，有的下痢清谷，用通脉四逆汤，或者是干姜附子汤。有时候热利怎么办，那就是白头翁汤。疟疾霍乱都会有这种情形。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172121-u5zg134","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172121-u5zg134"}},{"ID":"20240312172107-5taah2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172107-5taah2u","updated":"20240312172107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百八十九条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172107-5z9e2xu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172107-5z9e2xu","updated":"20240312172107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：下利，欲饮水者，以有热故也，「白头翁汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172107-2bqb2bl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172107-2bqb2bl","updated":"20240312172107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白头翁汤有热利，想喝水，喝冷水，有热的关系。记得，只要病人想喝水都没有问题，都很好治。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172107-fmifhj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172107-fmifhj5","updated":"20240312172107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白头翁汤症，一剂下去就好了。病名可能是疟疾，可能是吃坏肚子下利都没关系，我们不管病名，只管症。"}]},{"ID":"20240312172107-ndopwah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312172107-ndopwah","updated":"20240312172107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下痢欲饮水，代表肠胃功能很好。"}]}]}